    "description": "The Energy Usage Alerts API provides access to a comprehensive list of alerts related to energy usage within a given system. This endpoint allows users to retrieve current and historical alerts that may indicate unusual energy consumption patterns or potential issues. Typical consumers of this API include energy managers, sustainability analysts, and system administrators who monitor energy efficiency and usage trends. By leveraging this information, organizations can make informed decisions to optimize energy consumption and address potential inefficiencies.",
